{"about_the_game":"A nostalgia-infused pixel clicker in a comedy wrapper.\u00a0<br>You play the part of a colonist set out to conquer new planets. As a supernova explosion takes out your ship's energy reserves, your only hope of getting back on course is a jerry-rigged old dynamo. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699180/extras/1bc2ad0d318c63bc2487c4a20093ff6d.poster.avif?t=1769119981\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699180/extras/1bc2ad0d318c63bc2487c4a20093ff6d.webm?t=1769119981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699180/extras/1bc2ad0d318c63bc2487c4a20093ff6d.mp4?t=1769119981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The game has: <br>* Stylish retro graphics <br>* A witty computer for a partner <br>* Ship improvements in all directions: a dynamo, a potato farm for energy generation and, of course, an antimatter distiller <br>* Smooth acceleration up to hyper-speed\u00a0<br>* Space octopuses <br>And no lootboxes!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699180/extras/a92b8572c8fe37bf9eba5a940832ffee.avif?t=1769119981\" width=616 height=108 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Space firefighter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/699180/afbbe1b8c255a2c52bd5968a9add282b3bcd1deb.jpg"},{"name":"Cat and Mouse!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/699180/cc31c24eb307d5215f45e33316d1f208d3804ab0.jpg"},{"name":"Full upgrade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/699180/3dfb9254a81ebfa5baf828cbf2a1aedc58692045.jpg"},{"name":"Goodbye, asteroids!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic