k on course is a jerry-rigged old dynamo. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699180/extras/1bc2ad0d318c63bc2487c4a20093ff6d.poster.avif?t=1769119981\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699180/extras/1bc2ad0d318c63bc2487c4a20093ff6d.webm?t=1769119981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699180/extras/1bc2ad0d318c63bc2487c4a20093ff6d.mp4?t=1769119981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The game has: <br>* Stylish retro graphics <br>* A witty computer for a partner <br>* Ship improvements in all directions: a dynamo, a potato farm for energy generation and, of course, an antimatter distiller <br>* Smooth acceleration up to hyper-speed\u00a0<br>* Space octopuses <br>And no lootboxes!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699180/extras/a92b8572c8fe37bf9eba5a940832ffee.avif?t=1769119981\" width=616 height=108 /></span>","developers":["Shiv"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/699180/header.jpg?t=1769119981","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/699180/1539915307/e051ef74ff1174ca5908f4fadebc937ed0893fbb/1769119060/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769119918","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/699180/1539915307/e051ef74ff1174ca5908f4fadebc937ed0893fbb/1769119060/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769119918","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/699180/1539915307/e051ef74ff1174ca5908f4fadebc937ed0893fbb/1769119060/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769119918","id":25727